WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.350
A new guardian dragon will appear?

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.170
Yes.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.730
This old man named Baltazari said so.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:16.400
That we should go to the Lake of Sand, 
where a new guardian dragon will emerge.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.860
The sage of fate?

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:23.670
The Chronicle of this continent 
has been stained black, too.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.880
We have no time to waste.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.500
We need to muster
all the forces at our disposal.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Please help us, Ashrina.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.040
If Baltazari says so...

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.990
This may be the right time
to put that to the test.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.510
Farrah.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:43.400
Yes.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.300
After Yuri defeated the blackened dragon,

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:53.520
we found this at the shrine ruins
it used to live in.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.770
Is this a song?

00:00:55.770 --> 00:01:00.740
I have always wanted to 
have Musica sing this.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.000
Her voice might cause some sort of reaction.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.870
Musica?

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.990
A forest sprite who they call
 the legendary songstress.

00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:12.720
Indeed, I don't think anyone else
could sing this song.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:16.840
So we're going to awaken
the dragon with a song?

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:18.660
That's pretty awesome.

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.830
We owe Yuri a debt of gratitude

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:26.490
and would never turn down an opportunity
to help fight the Black King.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:30.160
Farrah, I'd like you to find Musica
and bring her here.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.510
Can you do that?

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:32.470
Understood.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:34.480
May I go with her?

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.230
Of course.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:38.300
Your Majesty! Kalifa!

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.180
Keep it down. What are you yelling for?

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.440
An army...

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:45.730
An army approaches bearing 
the banner of the Nine Territories!

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.610
We estimate they number roughly 10,000 men.

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:48.750
The Nine Territories?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.250
It's that damn Shuza.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:52.910
Your Majesty, we must ready the army.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.250
Wait, please.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:01.210
Another army, also numbering 10,000,
has already appeared to face them.

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:03.860
Another army?

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.710
The Holy Guard of the Holy Kingdom.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:11.230
Led by Holy Queen Juliana!

00:03:55.580 --> 00:04:01.590
<b>The Flower in the Desert</b>

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:59.860
They have yet to make a move.

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:02.450
They must be waiting to see what we do first.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:05.540
Shall we send messengers?

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:10.080
None of the messengers we sent have returned.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.680
I suspect it would be of no use.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.920
The same thing happened with our messengers.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:18.590
<i>We may have no choice but to fight.</i>

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.280
Hold your positions!

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:26.270
I bring a message from Ashrina, 
Queen of the Desert.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:31.410
If you fight now,
neither party will leave unscathed.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.140
That being the case,

00:04:33.140 --> 00:04:37.310
should you not settle this with words,
rather than with swords?

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:41.210
We of the Lake of Sand 
will provide a venue for you to talk.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.490
Bring one hundred men each.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:49.740
Sending troops to die before we face the
Black King would be the height of stupidity.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:54.260
Neither the Holy Queen nor the
distinguished leaders of the Nine Territories

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.200
could be so foolish as to do such a thing.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.510
I trust that you will accept 
this offer graciously.

00:05:01.510 --> 00:05:03.200
Preposterous.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.180
Shall we shoot him down?

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.030
No.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.190
This sounds amusing.

00:05:07.190 --> 00:05:09.030
We will accept their offer.

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:09.730
But...

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:14.450
I want to know just how that girl has
the gall to call herself the Holy Queen.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:18.080
Taking her down can wait until after that.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.530
Will you accept their offer, then?

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:23.120
Yes. This is an unexpected opportunity.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.950
If we can successfully negotiate 
with them, we all win.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.470
Let's go, Einslotte.

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.340
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:33.680
Your Majesty the Holy Queen.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:39.090
I am Kalifa, aide to Her Majesty Ashrina.

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.100
I congratulate you on your coronation.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.670
Thank you for your gracious welcome.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:49.310
Forgive us for arriving 
unannounced with an army.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:52.640
There is nothing to forgive.

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:54.820
Hey, long time.

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.200
Aram?!

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.650
Why are you here?

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.210
Why, you ask?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:06.290
To save Yuri and take down 
the Black King, of course.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.860
All right.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:12.300
I'm sure Yuri will appreciate it.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.820
Let's do our best, Aram.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.870
Hey, don't treat me like a kid.

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:25.810
So, you've come.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.050
H-Hey, don't ignore me!

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:35.440
Aram.

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.780
Leave this to us.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.350
She should be around here somewhere.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.050
What?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:11.060
Are you telling me to give up the throne?

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.060
No.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.000
You're free to call yourself
the Holy Queen or whatever.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:19.070
But you will forfeit your command
over the Holy Guard.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:21.240
I could never.

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:24.080
I would no longer be the Holy Queen.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.580
Oh?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:30.200
Not only was your flag bearer, Yuri,
defeated by the Black King,

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:34.080
he has also succumbed to the darkness.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:38.980
I've also heard that one of your men 
has blackened and become a demon.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.340
You aren't fit for the role.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:46.230
Something that you yourself are well aware of.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:51.230
That's why you put off taking the throne and
left others to do your job, was it not?

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.550
Well...

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.460
Well?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:01.240
Well what, Holy Queen Juliana?

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:04.360
Shuza, you're...

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.380
<i>This doesn't look good.</i>

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.580
<i>Shuza is an expert at provoking people.</i>

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.010
<i>This won't end well.</i>

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.870
We're under attack!

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.000
What's going on?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.800
Sir! The Black Army has arrived!

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:37.470
Looks like I'll have to take care of them
before I deal with the Holy Queen.

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:42.150
They picked the worst possible time to attack!

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:44.720
Shall we mobilize the troops we left behind?

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:48.860
No, we will take them out
with what we have here.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.650
This looks like it's going to be fun.

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:04.380
You...

00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:31.410
Die.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:53.160
You're an interesting puppet.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.840
What a pathetic sight.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.360
How sad.

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:06.310
Burckhardt.

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:09.890
I heard you'd ascended to the throne.

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:13.920
Shall I congratulate you, Juliana?

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:20.510
You seem so miserable now.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.870
Is the crown of the Holy Queen that heavy?

00:10:24.340 --> 00:10:28.720
You're so pitiful, I can't bear to watch.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.230
Your Majesty!

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:46.270
You have such fire within you.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:48.240
Why hold it back?

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:50.660
Why not do as you wish?

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.670
Just like how you cast me aside!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:10:59.620
No.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.000
I...

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:02.580
It was for your own good.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.790
I don't need your excuses.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.910
Whatever you thought you were doing,

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:11.390
all that matters is what I felt 
and what it resulted in.

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:15.120
You're far too pathetic as you are now.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:19.360
You couldn't hope defeat Shuza, 
let alone our master, the Black King.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:23.390
I don't want to see you like this anymore.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:27.770
I'll take care of him.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.320
Old man.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.970
You're alive? Good, very good.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:38.570
Do you happen to know
where Shuza and Juliana are?

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:39.810
No idea.

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:40.950
Not in all this chaos.

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:42.320
Damn it.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.300
I didn't want to let them out of my sight.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:50.310
Given the situation, there's no telling 
what sort of accidents might happen.

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.260
Accidents?

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:54.780
Those two are like oil and water.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.130
They'll likely never come
to an understanding,

00:11:57.130 --> 00:11:59.220
and they both know that.

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:03.730
Should this battle present them with
the chance to strike the other down,

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:05.080
what do you think will happen?

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:11.040
And if one of them were to be killed,

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:15.940
a bloodbath would surely follow.

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:18.240
I won't let that happen.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.250
How strange.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:47.520
If only...

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.530
If only it weren't for you!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.690
You took the words
right out of my mouth.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.750
Why do you stand in my way, Shuza?

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.370
You're the one in my way.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:06.460
An incompetent girl like you,
calling herself the Holy Queen?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.830
Don't make me laugh!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.220
You know nothing of me.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.060
You have no idea how hard it was
for me to make that decision!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.910
Shuza, I'm going to defeat you!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.190
If I do that...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.690
No, I have to!

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.350
Or else I...

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.410
Damn brat.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.670
It's you who shall die!

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:04.680
My...

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.110
How amusing.

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:34.340
Stop!

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:19.610
What was I...

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:24.320
You two nearly let the blackness
engulf you just now.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.620
You should have noticed sooner, idiots.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.160
Good grief.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.300
You're a stubborn lot.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:41.010
Too bad. Juliana nearly became one of us.

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:48.950
Do you resist, Juliana?

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:54.040
Despite the freedom we have on this side?

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.090
Shut up, Burckhardt.

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.460
I remember what you said.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:01.100
"The next time we meet will be your last."

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.720
Well, it's time to keep that promise!

00:16:06.310 --> 00:16:09.760
I'll shut that big mouth of yours, brat!

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:16.190
Aram!

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.810
Old man Kalifa told me.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:26.080
If either you or Shuza die, there's no 
telling what will happen to your men.

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.080
So...

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:31.450
I'm not letting you die!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:40.680
What?

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:46.260
I'll kill anyone in my way.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.630
Furball!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:17.600
Guardian dragon of the Lake of Sand, 
bestow upon us the light of hope.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.060
Break through the darkness.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:39.680
You can do it, Aram.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.620
Furball?

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.510
A guardian dragon?

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.590
Tch. They have the upper hand here.

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:47.970
Burckhardt!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:18:58.930
Hey.

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:04.120
Give back the Chronicle.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.800
You don't deserve it.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:33.920
The Chronicle...

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.270
It turned white again.

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.820
Thank you, Aram.

00:19:52.930 --> 00:19:54.310
Furball.

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:56.170
Damn it, you surprised me!

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.580
You were a guardian dragon?

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.380
Thanks, though.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.090
You saved us.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:10.730
You're Musica, correct?

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.840
We've come for you.

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:13.980
For me?

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:14.730
Yeah.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:19.310
The sword that cuts through the darkness 
needs you your help.

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:23.150
Juliana.

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:30.230
I'm going to kick the Black King's ass

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.110
and bring Yuri back.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:35.160
So help me out.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:36.910
No, <i>please</i> help me.

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.370
I beg you!

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:45.860
No, I should be the one asking you.

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:50.810
Please allow the Holy Guard 
to join the Suppression Army.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:52.360
May we?

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.200
Yeah.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:57.610
Of course.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:02.770
May the gods bless the Suppression Army.

00:21:02.770 --> 00:21:05.080
And the Volunteer Army.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.520
Aram.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.570
Good news, Phoena.

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:14.000
The Holy Guard is going to help us.

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:18.860
Shuza.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:24.270
I apologize for attempting
such a cowardly attack.

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:26.580
But we're even, are we not?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.980
I'm sure you understand now.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:31.710
Join us.

00:21:35.420 --> 00:21:38.320
I'll travel my own path.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:41.110
Shuza...

00:21:51.980 --> 00:21:53.570
Are you sure we should let him go?

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:54.640
Yes.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:58.950
I doubt he will stand in our way.

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:02.020
All right.

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:03.370
Let's go, everyone!

00:22:10.540 --> 00:22:12.920
Just you wait, Yuri.

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>The Sword That Rends Darkness</b>

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:48.790
Fate is set in motion.
